3. END OF THE RIGHT OF USE (FORMER CUSTOMERS)

   3.1  The right of use ends automatically, without notice and without
        compensation, at the moment you stop being an Active Customer, for
        instance because the agreement is terminated, expires or is not
        renewed, or because of a material breach.

   3.2  From that moment you must stop using the Software, and within 30 days
        remove it (including copies and modifications) from all systems under
        your control and confirm this in writing on request. Former Customers
        have no right to updates, fixes or support for the Software.

   3.3  Becoming an Active Customer again restores the right of use from the
        date of the new agreement, under the terms of that agreement.


